    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Geni\u015f Tan\u0131t\u0131m Metni:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulaton \u2013 Preparation for the Final Journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Simulation | Realistic | Spiritual Experience<br><strong>Platform:</strong> PC (Steam)<br><strong>Mode:</strong> Single Player</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f <strong>A Silent Duty, A Profound Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is the most inevitable truth of life. <strong>Gassal Simulaton\u00a0</strong>invites you to take part in this sacred duty. As a gassal, you will respectfully prepare the deceased for their final journey and experience this spiritual process in the most realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the morgue to the cemetery, manage every step with <strong>patience, care, and deep contemplation.</strong> In the silence, you will work alone, feeling the weight and significance of each action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Step by Step \u2013 The Final Farewell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Preparation:</strong> Organize your inventory, gather the necessary materials, and create a respectful environment.<br>\u2714 <strong>Morgue Procedures:</strong> Verify the identity of the deceased and carefully follow the proper procedures.<br>\u2714 <strong>Washing Process:</strong> Adjust the water temperature, wash, rinse, and complete the cleansing with rose water.<br>\u2714 <strong>Shrouding:</strong> Wrap the deceased according to religious and cultural customs.<br>\u2714 <strong>Placing in the Coffin:</strong> Handle with care and ensure everything is properly arranged.<br>\u2714 <strong>Burial Process:</strong> Dig the grave, lower the coffin, and complete the burial with respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey requires <strong>no haste, no negligence, and no disrespect\u2014only patience, precision, and reverence.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Deeply Immersive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Meticulously designed locations such as the morgue, washing area, and cemetery.</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fully interactive objects:</strong> Water, soap, shroud, coffin, shovel, and other burial tools.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Weather &amp; Lighting Effects:</strong> Misty mornings, twilight shadows, and dynamic lighting enhance the solemn atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Sound &amp; Spiritual Immersion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>An auditory experience designed for deep reflection and mindfulness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Realistic ambient sounds:</strong> Flowing water, soft winds, distant birds, and footsteps.<br>\u2714 <strong>Subtle, atmospheric background music to support the spiritual experience.</strong><br>\u2714 <strong>Complete Silence Mode:</strong> Play with no sound at all and focus solely on the moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f In Silence, With Respect, The Final Duty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s <strong>a journey.</strong> A unique simulation that reminds us of life\u2019s impermanence and invites deep contemplation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fulfill your final duty?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Geni\u015f Tan\u0131t\u0131m Metni:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gassal Simulaton \u2013 Preparation for the Final Journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Simulation | Realistic | Spiritual Experience<br><strong>Platform:</strong> PC (Steam)<br><strong>Mode:</strong> Single Player</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f <strong>A Silent Duty, A Profound Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is the most inevitable truth of life. <strong>Gassal Simulaton\u00a0</strong>invites you to take part in this sacred duty. As a gassal, you will respectfully prepare the deceased for their final journey and experience this spiritual process in the most realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the morgue to the cemetery, manage every step with <strong>patience, care, and deep contemplation.</strong> In the silence, you will work alone, feeling the weight and significance of each action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Step by Step \u2013 The Final Farewell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Preparation:</strong> Organize your inventory, gather the necessary materials, and create a respectful environment.<br>\u2714 <strong>Morgue Procedures:</strong> Verify the identity of the deceased and carefully follow the proper procedures.<br>\u2714 <strong>Washing Process:</strong> Adjust the water temperature, wash, rinse, and complete the cleansing with rose water.<br>\u2714 <strong>Shrouding:</strong> Wrap the deceased according to religious and cultural customs.<br>\u2714 <strong>Placing in the Coffin:</strong> Handle with care and ensure everything is properly arranged.<br>\u2714 <strong>Burial Process:</strong> Dig the grave, lower the coffin, and complete the burial with respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey requires <strong>no haste, no negligence, and no disrespect\u2014only patience, precision, and reverence.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Deeply Immersive Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Meticulously designed locations such as the morgue, washing area, and cemetery.</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fully interactive objects:</strong> Water, soap, shroud, coffin, shovel, and other burial tools.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Weather &amp; Lighting Effects:</strong> Misty mornings, twilight shadows, and dynamic lighting enhance the solemn atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Sound &amp; Spiritual Immersion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>An auditory experience designed for deep reflection and mindfulness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Realistic ambient sounds:</strong> Flowing water, soft winds, distant birds, and footsteps.<br>\u2714 <strong>Subtle, atmospheric background music to support the spiritual experience.</strong><br>\u2714 <strong>Complete Silence Mode:</strong> Play with no sound at all and focus solely on the moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f In Silence, With Respect, The Final Duty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s <strong>a journey.</strong> A unique simulation that reminds us of life\u2019s impermanence and invites deep contemplation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fulfill your final duty?</p>",
